  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO Albanien mentalhealth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WHO Albanien mentalhealth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of mental health care teams. Mental health reform work in Albania, as a part of WHO&apos;s wider programme for the whole region. The aim is to offer both remaining refugees and albanians mental health care, and to start building a community based national mental health system, in collaboration with the Ministry of Health.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning av h&#xe4;slov&#xe5;rdsteam. Mentalv&#xe5;rdsreform i Albanien som del i WHOs vidare program som str&#xe4;cker sig &#xf6;ver hela regionen. Syftet &#xe4;r att erbjuda albaner och kvarvarande flyktingar mentalv&#xe5;rd, och att b&#xf6;rja bygga upp ett decentraliserat nationellt mentalh&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rdssystem i samarbete med H&#xe4;lsoministreriet i Albanien.</narrative>
  </description>
